[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800200_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800200_04_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800200_04_0010","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800200_04_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800200_04_0020","text":"啊，那个，路加酱……！\n超帅的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800200_04_0030","text":"能不能让我拍个视频参考一下呀……\n想反复看当范本……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800200_04_0040","text":"……已经，结束了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800200_04_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800200_04_0050","text":"找教练要的话……有录像的吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800200_04_0060","text":"……？\n啊，但是——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800200_04_0070","text":"走掉了……明明是因为路加酱太棒了\n才想拿来参考的说……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800200_04_0080","text":"——刚才的画面，好好印在脑子里吧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800200_04_0090","text":"对了，录一下自己的舞蹈看看怎么样……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800200_04_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800200_04_0100","text":"啊啊……跟路加酱完全不一样～～……！"}]
